  "title": "Oh My Arctic Char!",
  "description": "This arctic char recipe uses rosemary, garlic, lime, cayenne, and a big splash of sherry wine for a flavorful sauce in this easy, baked fish dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "melanienl"
  ],
